  "description": "After saving another world and barely returning to my original body, I found myself transformed into a pervert who seduced the Empire's mad dog, Lexion, begging him to spank my butt. Trembling in fear from the man who looked ready to wring my neck at any moment, a system message I thought I'd never see again announced:\n\n\\[System Message\\] The Destiny Quest begins. Getting Spanked by Destiny (0/100)?!\n\nBefore I could even question it, my soul-swapped body reacted sensitively to Lexion's touch. Nadia, who had never held a man's hand before, found herself unintentionally enduring days where her flesh and bones burned. A life that seems like M, yet isn't quite M, but still feels like M.\n\n *“Me, an M...?”*\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
